Z||000005||crash||10-26-2001||08:43 AM||||actually, It is known that black attracts heat, in this case from the head, thus cooling it down and allowing gas to run cooler. So I'd say it is a performance mod. You might be getting %.0000000000000000000000001 performance increase, but man, It's better than nothing....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>BTW, I like your paint job. Very well detailed.<BR>||||reg||1
